<view class="page"><view class="brand-kicker">CHILD PROFILE <text>FAMILY</text></view><view class="hero-title">孩子信息</view><view class="hero-sub">帮助计划与提醒更贴合当前情况</view><view class="profile-form"><view class="avatar">{{initial}}</view><view class="form-label">孩子称呼</view><input class="input" value="{{form.childName}}" bindinput="inputName" maxlength="8"/><view class="form-label">年龄</view><view class="stepper"><button data-step="-1" bindtap="changeAge">−</button><text>{{form.age}} 岁</text><button data-step="1" bindtap="changeAge">＋</button></view><view class="form-label">年级</view><input class="input" value="{{form.grade}}" bindinput="inputGrade" placeholder="例如：小学二年级"/><view class="form-label">当前运动目标</view><view class="chips"><button wx:for="{{goals}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{form.goal===item?'active':''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="chooseGoal">{{item}}</button></view><button class="btn btn-primary save" bindtap="save">保存信息</button></view><view class="privacy">仅填写完成运动计划所需的基础信息，当前演示数据保存在本机。</view></view>
